OL,3,GNEWSADrugs found in baby's cot in raid
OL,4,Aas three arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlister packs were found in a baby's
OL,7,Fcot following a raid of two properties
OL,8,Fin Wolverhampton, as part of a probe
OL,9,Finto the large-scale supply and
OL,10,Fdistribution of illicit drugs.
OL,12,FOfficers stormed an address in
OL,13,FWednesfield on Wednesday and also
OL,14,Fseized 2,000 Class B tablets and a
OL,15,Fstolen motorcycle.
OL,17,FA woman in her 40s was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of being concerned in the
OL,19,Fsupply of controlled drugs and child
OL,20,Fendangerment, West Midlands Police
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
