OL,3,GNEWSADrugs found in baby's cot in raid
OL,4,Aas three arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Particularly concerning was the
OL,7,Fdiscovery of suspected drug-related
OL,8,Fitems in close proximity to a child,"
OL,9,Fsaid Det Insp Rich McCorry of Greater
OL,10,FManchester Police, who assisted with
OL,11,Fthe raid.
